WEBVTT

01:36.460 --> 01:41.009
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.259 --> 01:43.979
[Episode 13]

01:54.479 --> 01:55.880
Are you a human or a ghost?

01:56.400 --> 01:57.870
Why do you look so familiar?

01:57.870 --> 01:58.870
-Yeah.
-Let's go.

01:59.759 --> 02:00.290
Don't go.

02:02.510 --> 02:04.350
[Du Yueshan, Mengxiang Sect Leader]

02:15.870 --> 02:17.430
Well, is he dead or alive?

02:20.960 --> 02:21.430
Hold on.

02:28.900 --> 02:29.560
Be careful!

02:49.120 --> 02:51.280
Finally, some meat to eat!

02:52.120 --> 02:53.560
Big chunks of meat.

02:53.840 --> 02:55.520
Fresh meat!

02:58.190 --> 02:58.920
Old monster,

02:59.079 --> 03:00.360
we haven't bathed for three months.

03:00.360 --> 03:01.310
Our meat will taste sour.

03:01.310 --> 03:02.310
Not edible at all.

03:02.310 --> 03:03.510
T-This crazy old man.

03:03.590 --> 03:04.940
Is he one of Qu Hanshan's men?

03:04.940 --> 03:05.780
Good.

03:06.360 --> 03:08.470
Unwashed men taste even better!

03:10.560 --> 03:12.030
The Sword King has blocked the entrance.

03:12.030 --> 03:13.960
And we can't get out of here either.

03:14.190 --> 03:17.030
Looks like
he also fell victim to Qu Hanshan.

03:22.430 --> 03:23.150
Sir,

03:24.150 --> 03:27.010
you were also imprisoned here
by Qu Hanshan, right?

03:27.710 --> 03:29.570
Why don't we join hands to escape?

03:30.240 --> 03:31.079
Escape?

03:31.520 --> 03:32.190
No!

03:33.240 --> 03:34.470
I want meat now.

03:34.560 --> 03:36.560
I haven't had meat for a long time!

03:41.800 --> 03:42.360
Dodge!

03:48.710 --> 03:49.310
Tang Fang!

03:53.310 --> 03:55.470
Finally, I can eat some meat.

04:04.970 --> 04:07.140
[Du Yueshan]

04:09.430 --> 04:11.630
Let me go!

04:13.150 --> 04:15.470
Mengxiang Sect Leader, Du Yueshan?

04:18.040 --> 04:19.240
Can't believe this crazy old man

04:19.240 --> 04:21.070
is one of the Three Peaks
along with Qu Hanshan and Gu Junshan,

04:21.070 --> 04:22.560
the renowned Du Yueshan!

04:22.830 --> 04:24.120
How did this legendary Du Yueshan

04:24.120 --> 04:24.840
end up here

04:24.870 --> 04:25.680
and go mad?

04:28.310 --> 04:29.120
I see.

04:29.600 --> 04:32.630
He seems to have been poisoned
by the Power Gang's Dead-Bat Venom,

04:32.630 --> 04:34.230
which made him lose his mind.

04:34.560 --> 04:35.830
Strike his Jingmen

04:36.310 --> 04:37.510
and Baihui acupoints

04:37.600 --> 04:39.200
to vent his internal energy,

04:39.310 --> 04:40.360
and he can recover.

04:40.360 --> 04:42.240
But given his insanity
and formidable martial arts,

04:42.240 --> 04:43.570
it's hard to pull it off!

04:44.950 --> 04:46.280
One-on-one won't work.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.090
But now there are four of us.

04:49.480 --> 04:50.480
I want meat!

04:50.600 --> 04:51.360
I got it.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.510
I want meat right now!

04:54.510 --> 04:55.430
Come on, old freak! Come on!

04:55.430 --> 04:56.680
Eat me! Come on!

04:56.680 --> 04:58.270
I'll tear you all apart!

04:59.240 --> 05:00.310
I taste good! Come eat me!

05:00.310 --> 05:00.950
Old freak!

05:19.750 --> 05:20.390
Sir.

05:21.600 --> 05:22.160
Sir?

05:24.000 --> 05:24.600
Mr. Du?

05:27.390 --> 05:30.190
The poison has dissipated
with his internal energy.

05:30.190 --> 05:31.520
He should recover soon.

05:36.200 --> 05:36.760
Oh, no.

05:37.510 --> 05:39.040
Someone's setting fire outside.

05:39.040 --> 05:41.040
No wonder I smell burnt pig hair.

05:41.070 --> 05:41.750
What now?

05:42.720 --> 05:43.630
Xiao Qiushui!

05:44.950 --> 05:46.070
Either you come out,

05:46.070 --> 05:47.600
or you suffocate from the smoke.

05:47.600 --> 05:48.870
Take your pick.

05:50.020 --> 05:50.680
Fan faster.

05:50.870 --> 05:51.360
Yes!

05:54.560 --> 05:56.070
We have no other choice now.

05:56.070 --> 05:57.070
Let's go that way.

05:57.240 --> 05:57.750
Wait,

05:58.020 --> 05:59.170
what about this crazy old man?

05:59.170 --> 06:00.100
Take him with us.

06:04.120 --> 06:05.320
Be careful. Let's go.

06:05.360 --> 06:06.040
Okay, move.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.530
Take it slow. Good. Keep going.

06:24.430 --> 06:25.240
How's it?

06:26.390 --> 06:27.190
Any way out?

06:30.120 --> 06:30.980
It's a dead end.

06:31.160 --> 06:33.690
Up ahead is a stone wall.
We can't get through.

06:34.290 --> 06:36.070
-Help Mr. Du sit down.
-Come on.

06:43.830 --> 06:46.120
There's a waterfall
cascading from above

06:46.120 --> 06:48.310
nonstop. It must be
an ever-flowing stream.

06:48.310 --> 06:50.070
There might be a way out below.

06:51.480 --> 06:52.270
But...

06:56.190 --> 06:58.590
Things are critical. We can't linger here.

06:58.680 --> 07:01.540
Looks like we have to explore
the bottom of the pond.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.560
What should we do?

07:09.070 --> 07:10.120
-He's come around!
-You...

07:10.120 --> 07:10.780
He's awake!

07:12.750 --> 07:13.950
What's wrong with you again?

07:13.950 --> 07:14.610
You guys...

07:14.720 --> 07:15.870
Who exactly are you?

07:19.040 --> 07:20.800
I am Tang Fang from the Tang Sect.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.800
These are Tie Xingyue and Qiu Nangu.

07:24.070 --> 07:26.630
Sir, this is your personal token,
isn't it?

07:29.310 --> 07:32.630
Indeed. I am Du Yueshan.

07:34.190 --> 07:36.159
Are you really Mr. Du?

07:36.920 --> 07:38.180
How did you end up here?

07:38.720 --> 07:41.430
It's all
because of that old scoundrel Qu Hanshan!

07:41.430 --> 07:43.159
He tricked me into coming here for a duel,

07:43.159 --> 07:46.240
yet imprisoned me
with the Dragon-Binding Rope for years

07:46.240 --> 07:49.210
in order to force me to hand over
the Mengxiang Sword Technique.

07:49.210 --> 07:51.050
How despicable Qu Hanshan is!

07:51.300 --> 07:52.159
Unbelievable!

07:52.830 --> 07:56.159
Sir, I am Xiao Qiushui.
I just drained your internal energy.

07:56.920 --> 07:58.000
Sorry for the offense.

07:58.000 --> 07:58.800
Never mind.

08:00.070 --> 08:01.160
Were it not for you,

08:01.270 --> 08:02.310
the Dead-Bat Venom

08:02.310 --> 08:04.840
would eventually cause me
to explode and die.

08:06.590 --> 08:07.270
By the way,

08:07.630 --> 08:08.950
how did you young ones

08:09.310 --> 08:11.600
end up being cornered here by Qu Hanshan?

08:15.120 --> 08:16.120
It's a long story.

08:16.600 --> 08:19.630
I've figured out Qu Hanshan's identity
as the Sword King.

08:19.630 --> 08:21.430
He wants to kill me to silence me.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.660
More importantly,

08:22.870 --> 08:24.400
he's going all out to stop me

08:24.630 --> 08:27.270
from returning
to the Xiao Residence of Huanhua Sect

08:27.270 --> 08:29.000
to save my parents from danger.

08:29.830 --> 08:33.090
Huanhua Sect? You're from the Xiao family
of Huanhua Sect?

08:35.270 --> 08:36.070
That's right.

08:36.720 --> 08:38.450
Then you'd better stay inside.

08:38.789 --> 08:40.150
Better to be caught by Qu Hanshan

08:40.150 --> 08:42.270
than end up in Liu Suifeng's hands.

08:44.750 --> 08:45.440
Sir,

08:46.200 --> 08:47.530
what do you mean by that?

08:49.000 --> 08:50.000
Don't you know?

08:50.790 --> 08:52.300
Liu Suifeng of the Power Gang

08:52.300 --> 08:54.500
has a vendetta against the Xiao family.

08:54.910 --> 08:56.870
Liu Suifeng wants to wipe out
the Xiao family.

08:56.870 --> 08:58.930
He definitely won't spare your life.

09:00.910 --> 09:03.770
Liu Suifeng has a vendetta
against the Xiao family?

09:05.960 --> 09:06.630
No way.

09:08.080 --> 09:10.210
I don't believe there's any vendetta.

09:11.200 --> 09:13.330
And be it the Power Gang or Liu Suifeng,

09:14.750 --> 09:16.150
I won't let any of them go!

09:20.600 --> 09:21.750
Our priority now

09:22.120 --> 09:23.360
is to find a way out.

09:23.670 --> 09:24.470
That's right.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.600
We need to find a way to get out first.

09:26.600 --> 09:28.030
This pond seems to have flowing water.

09:28.030 --> 09:29.360
It must lead somewhere.

09:30.270 --> 09:30.960
Sir,

09:31.320 --> 09:33.360
having been locked up here for so long,

09:33.360 --> 09:36.440
do you know what's beneath this pond?

09:36.790 --> 09:37.450
Brilliant,

09:38.510 --> 09:42.320
you're quite a perceptive young hero.

09:42.750 --> 09:44.360
I do know something about it.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.680
Let me point you in the right direction.

09:46.830 --> 09:48.190
You're a clever one.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.810
You were right earlier.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.080
There's a crack

09:52.630 --> 09:54.080
down there,

09:54.480 --> 09:57.140
but it's too narrow
for a person to pass through.

09:57.270 --> 09:59.150
After years of being trapped here,

09:59.150 --> 10:00.670
meditating every day,

10:00.960 --> 10:04.080
I finally figured out a solution
to this predicament.

10:04.630 --> 10:06.240
My Mengxiang Sword Technique

10:06.240 --> 10:09.000
includes a move
that can manipulate water with a sword.

10:09.000 --> 10:12.390
That is to wield a sword
to concentrate the power of water currents

10:12.390 --> 10:13.840
and break open a way out.

10:14.150 --> 10:15.550
-That's great!
-Nice!

10:15.550 --> 10:16.720
Sir, please use it right away

10:16.720 --> 10:17.980
-and take us out.
-Yes!

10:18.120 --> 10:18.960
But sir,

10:19.600 --> 10:22.000
you've lost your internal energy.

10:22.510 --> 10:24.910
So you can't perform your sword technique.

10:26.080 --> 10:27.120
It's okay.

10:27.910 --> 10:30.600
I can teach my Mengxiang Sword Technique

10:30.600 --> 10:32.320
to one of you.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.760
As long as you grasp its essence,

10:34.790 --> 10:36.250
even with quick learning,

10:36.440 --> 10:38.080
it will still work for sure.

10:40.440 --> 10:44.100
My hidden weapon skills are
totally different from sword skills.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.480
It's on you.

10:46.270 --> 10:47.510
S-Sir, how about me?

10:47.790 --> 10:48.960
My master died early,

10:48.960 --> 10:50.360
so I wouldn't mind becoming your disciple.

10:50.360 --> 10:52.150
Sir, look how tall, robust,

10:52.150 --> 10:53.080
and mighty I am.

10:53.320 --> 10:53.840
You?

10:55.030 --> 10:55.870
And you?

10:58.320 --> 10:59.550
No, no, no.

11:02.720 --> 11:04.120
You can't do this either.

11:04.480 --> 11:05.510
Didn't you say you could do it?

11:05.510 --> 11:07.200
Why do you think I can't do this?

11:07.200 --> 11:08.440
He's blind to talent.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.320
I'm so awesome.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.520
-You're no better than me.
-Fine, fine.

11:21.120 --> 11:22.920
Your aptitude seems quite good.

11:23.320 --> 11:25.720
I wonder
if your comprehension is up to par.

11:26.390 --> 11:27.080
Well then,

11:27.550 --> 11:29.750
how about
I teach my Mengxiang Sword Technique

11:29.750 --> 11:30.510
to you?

11:30.790 --> 11:32.510
Sir, please don't joke about this.

11:32.510 --> 11:33.640
That's impossible.

11:35.510 --> 11:36.030
Sir,

11:36.030 --> 11:38.120
whether we can get out of here
all depends on you!

11:38.120 --> 11:39.670
That's right.
None of us knows how to use a sword.

11:39.670 --> 11:40.790
We're counting on you.

11:40.790 --> 11:41.390
I...

11:42.960 --> 11:43.390
I...

11:43.720 --> 11:45.150
-Come on! Learn swordmanship from me.
-Wait, no.

11:45.150 --> 11:45.870
Let's go.

11:50.750 --> 11:52.440
Fan faster. Faster!

11:52.670 --> 11:53.750
Suffocate them with smoke!

11:53.750 --> 11:54.200
Yes.

13:02.200 --> 13:02.960
Liu Suifeng,

13:03.550 --> 13:06.120
First, you trespassed into
my Guangling territory,

13:06.120 --> 13:08.270
and now you even dare
meddle in my household affairs.

13:08.270 --> 13:09.120
Sword King.

13:10.510 --> 13:12.030
Why the hostility?

13:12.870 --> 13:15.130
Xiao Qiushui has tricked both you and me.

13:15.600 --> 13:17.150
Cunning and treacherous as he is,

13:17.150 --> 13:18.390
if pushed too far,

13:18.720 --> 13:20.390
he'd rather destroy everything

13:20.390 --> 13:22.390
than let anyone gain any advantage.

13:22.790 --> 13:25.150
I suggest you take a step back

13:26.150 --> 13:27.750
and see how he struggles next.

13:27.750 --> 13:29.410
He already knows my identity.

13:30.030 --> 13:32.320
I absolutely can't
let him survive out there.

13:32.320 --> 13:35.320
With your status
in the Guangling martial community,

13:35.720 --> 13:38.510
isn't it an easy thing to twist the truth?

13:39.630 --> 13:41.150
Don't waste time on him.

13:41.630 --> 13:44.910
The Hero Command Token is
what matters most now.

13:46.790 --> 13:49.650
You know the whereabouts
of the Hero Command Token?

13:51.000 --> 13:52.260
I've investigated it.

13:52.440 --> 13:55.770
There are only two possibilities
for the Token's location.

13:56.320 --> 13:58.180
It's either at the Xiao Residence

13:59.040 --> 14:01.830
or on Xiao Qiushui.

14:02.750 --> 14:05.120
With the one on Xiao Qiushui proven fake,

14:05.470 --> 14:08.420
the real one must be
at the Xiao Residence.

14:09.720 --> 14:10.440
Sword King,

14:12.030 --> 14:13.320
why don't we join hands

14:14.200 --> 14:16.000
to find that Hero Command Token?

14:17.440 --> 14:20.240
Deputy Chief Liu,
you've always been high and mighty,

14:20.240 --> 14:22.300
yet now you want to cooperate with me?

14:22.960 --> 14:23.890
I have no choice.

14:25.240 --> 14:27.870
The Xiao's Sword Manor is rigged
with self-destruct mechanisms.

14:27.870 --> 14:29.070
If we force our way in,

14:29.320 --> 14:31.380
fire bombs will destroy everything.

14:31.510 --> 14:33.570
To get the intact Hero Command Token,

14:33.600 --> 14:35.510
we can only break in from the inside.

14:35.510 --> 14:37.040
I've already been exposed,

14:37.550 --> 14:40.360
but you still stand a chance, Sword King.

14:41.150 --> 14:42.840
If we break into the Sword Manor,

14:42.840 --> 14:45.080
I'll be able to find Xiao Xilou
and have my revenge.

14:45.080 --> 14:46.150
And I'm willing

14:47.750 --> 14:50.510
to share this credit with you.

14:52.270 --> 14:54.150
You want me to go help the Xiao family?

14:54.150 --> 14:56.210
Given your reputation in Guangling,

14:56.480 --> 14:59.080
Xiao Yiren will surely come
to ask you for help.

14:59.080 --> 14:59.960
If I were you,

15:00.630 --> 15:01.960
I would agree to help him

15:02.720 --> 15:04.520
and infiltrate the Sword Manor.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.840
But if I let Xiao Qiushui survive,

15:06.840 --> 15:09.240
things might go sideways
and ruin my plans.

15:10.300 --> 15:11.760
Rest assured, Sword King.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.200
I know him well.

15:13.960 --> 15:15.120
He poses no threat.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.800
Have you mastered it?

15:24.910 --> 15:25.600
Be careful.

15:58.240 --> 16:00.120
W-Will he be alright?

16:00.630 --> 16:02.550
This sword skill is extremely draining.

16:02.550 --> 16:04.210
If he runs out of strength now,

16:04.440 --> 16:07.080
the current could very likely
carry him away.

16:08.630 --> 16:09.320
Qiushui!

16:10.790 --> 16:11.600
Qiushui!

16:17.030 --> 16:17.870
It's simple.

16:19.390 --> 16:20.650
I won't let him go back.

16:22.240 --> 16:24.040
I've got something up my sleeve.

16:25.630 --> 16:28.750
Dealing with Xiao Qiushui is
nothing hard for me.

16:29.630 --> 16:32.910
Then you can do whatever you want

16:33.510 --> 16:34.320
with him.

16:35.270 --> 16:38.150
Just keep him alive so that I can
have my revenge.

16:44.870 --> 16:46.730
Killing two birds with one stone.

16:46.750 --> 16:50.000
Deputy Chief Liu,
you sure are good at plotting.

16:54.080 --> 16:56.200
Qiushui! Qiushui!

16:57.320 --> 16:58.240
Qiushui!

17:04.270 --> 17:06.200
How's it? Did you break through it?

17:06.310 --> 17:07.440
Yes, I did it!

17:07.680 --> 17:08.310
Great!

17:08.310 --> 17:10.160
Excellent! We made it!

17:10.790 --> 17:12.589
They're coming after us! There!

17:13.400 --> 17:14.660
No time to waste. Jump!

17:14.960 --> 17:15.720
Go! Let's go!

17:29.640 --> 17:30.270
Master.

17:30.790 --> 17:32.720
Xiao Qiushui and the others
escaped through the waterway.

17:32.720 --> 17:35.850
Also, Xiao Yiren and his men are
already at our doorstep.

17:37.350 --> 17:39.010
They came at the perfect time.

17:43.330 --> 17:46.060
Shinian, don't be rude.
Stand down immediately.

17:49.830 --> 17:50.630
Mr. Qu.

17:52.590 --> 17:56.000
You Huanhua Sect members keep coming
to my residence to pick fights.

17:56.000 --> 17:58.260
Are you openly declaring war against me?

17:58.590 --> 17:59.400
Mr. Qu,

17:59.640 --> 18:01.880
I, Xiao Yiren,
along with my younger brother, Kaiyan,

18:01.880 --> 18:03.440
came here to pay our respects.

18:03.440 --> 18:05.790
We've long heard of your prestige
as He Who Shakes Guangling.

18:05.790 --> 18:07.520
We wouldn't dare to offend you.

18:07.790 --> 18:08.720
We're here today

18:08.880 --> 18:11.480
because of the Power Gang's siege
of the Xiao Residence.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.740
Mr. Qu, we hope that you

18:12.750 --> 18:14.150
can help us seek justice.

18:15.410 --> 18:18.230
Xiao Qiushui just barged into my mansion
with a crew of hooligans

18:18.230 --> 18:20.710
to mess around and ruin my reputation.

18:21.110 --> 18:24.110
And now you're here
to force me to help the Xiao family.

18:25.360 --> 18:26.990
What are you up to?

18:29.440 --> 18:30.200
Qiushui?

18:32.970 --> 18:33.660
Mr. Qu,

18:33.960 --> 18:36.350
perhaps
there's been some misunderstanding.

18:36.350 --> 18:37.640
Now, your brother

18:37.640 --> 18:39.790
is calling me
the Sword King of the Power Gang.

18:39.790 --> 18:42.830
He's slandered everyone at my residence
as Power Gang members

18:42.830 --> 18:45.240
and threatened to announce this
to the entire martial world

18:45.240 --> 18:46.920
to ruin my reputation.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.660
So I'm sorry. There's nothing

18:51.200 --> 18:53.600
I can do to help the Xiaos
out of the trouble.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.360
-Mr. Qu. Mr. Qu.
-Enough.

18:56.060 --> 18:58.680
Your brother, Xiao Qiushui,
calls us the Power Gang,

18:58.680 --> 19:01.310
but I think the people around him
are more like it.

19:01.310 --> 19:02.640
He's so skilled in framing.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.200
If not properly disciplined,

19:04.200 --> 19:06.640
he'll not only
ruin your family's reputation

19:06.640 --> 19:09.970
but also tend to become a menace
to the entire martial world.

19:16.960 --> 19:17.680
Yiren,

19:18.200 --> 19:19.480
did they get it wrong?

19:20.000 --> 19:22.200
How could Qiushui
possibly do such a thing?

19:22.200 --> 19:23.130
Qiushui usually

19:23.750 --> 19:25.680
does hang out with some shady folks

19:26.000 --> 19:27.590
and behave a bit inappropriately,

19:27.590 --> 19:29.120
but he wouldn't go this far.

19:29.640 --> 19:32.570
Could it be
that he's fallen for some villain's lies?

19:33.720 --> 19:34.580
How about this?

19:34.880 --> 19:37.590
I'll head back immediately
to investigate this matter.

19:37.590 --> 19:39.750
You go to the Divine Blade Hall
to visit Master Ge.

19:39.750 --> 19:40.310
Okay.

19:49.000 --> 19:50.440
We've been walking for so long.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.960
Where are we going?

19:52.350 --> 19:53.110
Mr. Du,

19:53.680 --> 19:54.960
this place is too treacherous to linger.

19:54.960 --> 19:56.790
We'll walk a few more miles
to the dock and take a boat.

19:56.790 --> 20:00.050
Then we'll reach
the Huanhua Sect's Guangling Villa soon.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.840
We're going to your home?

20:02.960 --> 20:04.400
My sister is skilled in medicine.

20:04.400 --> 20:06.400
Mr. Du, you have internal injuries.

20:06.790 --> 20:08.590
I believe my sister can heal you.

20:08.960 --> 20:09.880
After you recover,

20:09.880 --> 20:13.010
I'll have someone
escort you back to the Mengxiang Sect.

20:14.510 --> 20:16.270
I was harmed by that villain Qu

20:16.590 --> 20:18.160
and imprisoned for years,

20:18.880 --> 20:20.590
with half my cultivation gone.

20:20.590 --> 20:22.440
It's already a great stigma.

20:23.160 --> 20:25.880
And now you're exposing my miserable state

20:26.320 --> 20:27.970
to more people,

20:28.350 --> 20:29.950
to the entire martial world!

20:31.880 --> 20:34.000
I'd rather die right here.

20:34.200 --> 20:34.960
I won't go.

20:35.070 --> 20:35.790
Mr. Du,

20:36.310 --> 20:37.310
please calm down.

20:38.070 --> 20:40.880
It's just that your internal injuries...

20:41.640 --> 20:44.440
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.
I'm leaving.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.700
How about this, Mr. Du?

20:47.510 --> 20:50.750
I happen to have some silver nuggets here.

20:51.160 --> 20:53.160
Take some for your travel expenses.

20:55.240 --> 20:57.040
Thank you, young man. Farewell.

21:03.310 --> 21:04.030
-Sir.
-Sir!

21:05.400 --> 21:06.130
Bro, well...

21:14.480 --> 21:16.680
I still have some silver here.

21:17.350 --> 21:18.280
Take it with you,

21:18.640 --> 21:19.960
find a proper job,

21:20.160 --> 21:22.400
and never join the Power Gang.

21:22.880 --> 21:24.030
We don't want money.

21:24.030 --> 21:25.430
That's not what we meant.

21:25.640 --> 21:26.240
Sir,

21:26.510 --> 21:28.920
we brothers have been
in the martial world for years

21:28.920 --> 21:30.720
and seen assorted shady people.

21:31.240 --> 21:33.550
But we've never met a hero like you
who's so keen to help

21:33.550 --> 21:34.920
and do good deeds.

21:35.110 --> 21:36.200
We want to follow you.

21:36.200 --> 21:36.640
Yes.

21:37.900 --> 21:40.230
Instead of joining some third-rate sect,

21:40.240 --> 21:42.770
we'd rather be disciples
of the Huanhua Sect.

21:43.720 --> 21:45.110
Wait, but...

21:45.680 --> 21:48.200
Sir, you're not despising us, are you?

21:49.830 --> 21:50.350
Well,

21:51.520 --> 21:53.750
it seems that someone
with unorthodox training like us

21:53.750 --> 21:54.720
can only join

21:54.720 --> 21:55.830
those evil sects.

21:56.110 --> 21:57.720
Well, if we can't join the Power Gang,

21:57.720 --> 22:00.640
then let's try the Twelve Serial Docks.

22:03.400 --> 22:05.640
Take care, both of you.

22:10.400 --> 22:11.050
Hold on.

22:15.640 --> 22:18.680
I'm not despising you.

22:19.440 --> 22:23.590
It's just that joining the Xiao family is
quite complicated.

22:24.200 --> 22:25.880
And it's not just up to me.

22:26.590 --> 22:27.960
If you don't mind,

22:28.880 --> 22:31.540
you could join
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

22:34.070 --> 22:35.730
Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood?

22:36.400 --> 22:38.260
It has "zhou" (state) in its name.

22:38.510 --> 22:40.570
Sounds like a great sect, doesn't it?

22:40.680 --> 22:41.400
Yes.

22:42.110 --> 22:44.710
Is it even more powerful
than the Huanhua Sect?

22:45.720 --> 22:46.720
As long as you have

22:47.030 --> 22:49.590
a righteous and chivalrous heart,
regardless of background,

22:49.590 --> 22:52.270
everyone in Shenzhou
calls each other brother.

22:55.310 --> 22:58.040
A brotherhood that values
chivalry and loyalty!

22:58.550 --> 23:01.510
Then we're willing to join
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood!

23:01.510 --> 23:03.750
From now on, we'll follow you, sir.

23:06.350 --> 23:07.880
No need for that formality.

23:08.160 --> 23:10.620
From now on,
we'll call each other brothers.

23:11.160 --> 23:11.640
Good!

23:12.440 --> 23:12.920
Great!

23:13.550 --> 23:15.080
You not only saved our lives

23:15.160 --> 23:16.830
but also let us join
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

23:16.830 --> 23:18.400
From now on, we'll follow your lead only!

23:18.400 --> 23:19.730
You're our big brother.

23:20.160 --> 23:21.290
Hello, Big Brother.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.440
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

23:22.440 --> 23:23.500
Don't call me that.

23:23.960 --> 23:26.820
We'll venture through
the martial world together.

23:27.200 --> 23:30.640
Your Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
has such a random recruitment,

23:30.640 --> 23:32.640
letting just any "stray cats" join.

23:32.830 --> 23:34.200
I'd like to see

23:34.690 --> 23:36.140
when trouble comes,

23:36.170 --> 23:38.440
if they'll scatter
like rats from a sinking ship.

23:38.440 --> 23:40.720
What's with all this talk
of cats and rats?

23:40.720 --> 23:41.680
Which one of us looks like that?

23:41.680 --> 23:42.960
Are you so fond of animals?

23:42.960 --> 23:44.720
We definitely won't scatter like rats.

23:44.720 --> 23:45.310
Exactly.

23:45.920 --> 23:46.720
No, wait.

23:47.110 --> 23:48.240
She's insulting us.

23:48.510 --> 23:49.030
Not again!

23:49.030 --> 23:49.550
Alright, let's go.

23:49.550 --> 23:50.440
This is a bit over the top.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.900
She really holds a grudge.

23:57.690 --> 23:59.430
[Xiao Residence]

24:02.720 --> 24:04.050
I should write a notice,

24:04.160 --> 24:06.270
exposing all the dirty deeds
that old scoundrel,

24:06.270 --> 24:07.470
Qu Hanshan, has done.

24:07.590 --> 24:09.070
The so-called "He Who Shakes Guangling"?

24:09.070 --> 24:09.640
Bah!

24:09.960 --> 24:11.550
Right, we need to reveal it to the world.

24:11.550 --> 24:13.200
-Indeed!
-Call all martial artists

24:13.200 --> 24:15.070
to avenge the Free-Spirited Sage's death.

24:15.070 --> 24:15.680
Exactly.

24:16.030 --> 24:17.550
And we need to let the Power Gang know

24:17.550 --> 24:19.510
that recruiting Qu Hanshan, but not us,

24:19.510 --> 24:21.110
is one of their biggest losses.

24:21.110 --> 24:21.590
Yes!

24:21.720 --> 24:23.850
You really want to join the Power Gang?

24:24.310 --> 24:25.260
I once considered it.

24:25.260 --> 24:25.950
No, no.

24:25.970 --> 24:26.520
Qiushui.

24:29.790 --> 24:30.320
Qiushui.

24:31.480 --> 24:32.000
Yiren.

24:32.720 --> 24:33.330
Shinian.

24:38.830 --> 24:39.960
What does this mean?

24:41.000 --> 24:41.510
Yiren,

24:41.920 --> 24:42.980
what are you doing?

24:43.110 --> 24:44.440
They're all my friends.

24:45.880 --> 24:46.680
What friends?

24:47.030 --> 24:48.960
Friends who want to join the Power Gang?

24:48.960 --> 24:51.440
Our Huanhua Sect is now besieged
by the Power Gang.

24:51.440 --> 24:52.960
Mother and Father are struggling
to defend the Sword Manor.

24:52.960 --> 24:54.420
Aren't you worried at all?

24:54.510 --> 24:56.550
Yet you're making friends with these guys!

24:56.550 --> 24:58.280
Yiren, you really got me wrong.

24:58.310 --> 25:00.000
They are Tie Xingyue, Qiu Nangu,

25:00.000 --> 25:02.060
and Miss Tang Fang from the Tang Sect.

25:02.110 --> 25:04.000
If they hadn't escorted me all the way,

25:04.000 --> 25:05.720
I couldn't have made it back here.

25:05.720 --> 25:06.520
The Tang Sect?

25:07.790 --> 25:09.200
I'm Tang Fang from the Tang Sect.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.400
Greetings, Mr. Xiao.

25:14.110 --> 25:15.750
We two don't have such official tokens.

25:15.750 --> 25:18.030
But here are our names of integrity.

25:18.310 --> 25:20.570
Tie Xingyue, the Fart King of Wujiangdu.

25:20.830 --> 25:22.290
Qiu Nangu, the Iron Mouth.

25:22.750 --> 25:24.280
I've never heard of the sect

25:25.070 --> 25:26.200
called Wujiangdu.

25:26.590 --> 25:27.650
It doesn't matter.

25:28.400 --> 25:30.270
We've both joined

25:30.270 --> 25:32.400
Big Brother's Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

25:32.400 --> 25:33.930
We're a great brotherhood.

25:34.030 --> 25:36.760
We don't care about backgrounds,
only chivalry.

25:37.830 --> 25:38.400
Yiren,

25:39.200 --> 25:41.060
they truly are my sworn brothers.

25:41.200 --> 25:43.070
Were it not for them and Miss Tang
risking their lives to help me,

25:43.070 --> 25:44.550
I couldn't have escaped

25:44.550 --> 25:46.610
from the Sword King of the Power Gang.

25:46.880 --> 25:49.920
Are you
talking about Mr. Qu, Qu Hanshan?

25:50.200 --> 25:51.000
That's right.

25:51.640 --> 25:55.240
Qu Hanshan has been pretending
to be a heroic master for decades.

25:55.470 --> 25:56.930
-He actually...
-Shut up!

25:57.680 --> 25:59.240
As He Who Shakes Guangling, Mr. Qu

25:59.240 --> 26:00.400
has incredible prestige.

26:00.400 --> 26:02.330
How dare you slander him like this?

26:02.550 --> 26:05.720
I haven't properly questioned you
about this matter yet!

26:05.720 --> 26:08.070
Shinian, take good care of Miss Tang.

26:08.590 --> 26:10.790
As for these other disreputable scums,

26:10.960 --> 26:12.030
there's no need to invite them in.

26:12.030 --> 26:12.830
Wait a minute.

26:13.600 --> 26:14.800
Did he just insult us?

26:15.400 --> 26:18.030
He called us disreputable scums!

26:18.550 --> 26:19.030
You...

26:20.070 --> 26:22.030
You are our big brother's eldest brother,

26:22.030 --> 26:23.640
but you still can't speak to us so rudely.

26:23.640 --> 26:26.110
We two also have our pride!

26:30.070 --> 26:31.800
Drive these two out of here now!

26:35.050 --> 26:36.380
Who do you think you are?

26:38.310 --> 26:41.070
If we're not welcome here,
we'll find somewhere else to go.

26:41.070 --> 26:41.870
That's right.

26:42.270 --> 26:43.470
Let's go have dinner.

26:44.000 --> 26:45.920
Take care, Big Brother!

26:49.070 --> 26:49.590
Let's go.

26:49.590 --> 26:50.160
Yiren,

26:51.110 --> 26:52.750
Qu Hanshan was framing me.

26:53.310 --> 26:56.160
His mansion is the den of the Power Gang.

26:56.160 --> 26:57.720
That's enough! Stop it!

26:58.200 --> 27:01.310
Do you really want to force me
to discipline you with the punishing rod?

27:01.310 --> 27:01.920
Yiren.

27:02.720 --> 27:03.200
Xueyu.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.440
Please calm down.

27:05.750 --> 27:08.550
Qiushui, you must be tired
from your long journey.

27:08.680 --> 27:09.590
Stay calm

27:10.000 --> 27:12.600
and take your time to tell Yiren
what happened.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.200
Okay.

27:13.550 --> 27:15.000
Xueyu, you know

27:15.400 --> 27:17.640
the request for help is
of great importance now.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.170
But he's talking nonsense,

27:19.200 --> 27:20.440
antagonizing everyone.

27:20.440 --> 27:23.200
He's pushing our Xiao family into danger!

27:23.880 --> 27:25.790
It's exactly
because this matter is so important

27:25.790 --> 27:28.070
that I believe Qiushui
wouldn't speak recklessly,

27:28.070 --> 27:30.030
nor would he mess
with something this serious.

27:30.030 --> 27:31.690
Yiren, I'm telling the truth.

27:32.270 --> 27:34.130
Qu Hanshan is framing me like this

27:34.960 --> 27:37.160
just in order to hide his true identity.

27:38.310 --> 27:41.160
Mr. Gu Junshan discovered

27:41.160 --> 27:43.030
the flaw in Kang Chuyu,
the Nameless Demon,

27:43.030 --> 27:45.720
so Qu Hanshan killed him on the spot.

27:46.100 --> 27:47.500
The Free-Spirited Sage?

27:48.070 --> 27:50.400
You mean Qu Hanshan is
from the Power Gang,

27:51.110 --> 27:53.170
and Kang Chuyu is the Nameless Demon?

27:53.590 --> 27:54.850
If what you say is true,

27:55.270 --> 27:58.070
they've been hiding perfectly
all these years.

27:58.480 --> 28:00.640
Even if the others in the martial world
heard about this,

28:00.640 --> 28:02.200
they would never believe it.

28:02.200 --> 28:03.750
Yiren, this is true.

28:04.030 --> 28:05.310
If you don't believe me,

28:05.310 --> 28:06.680
Miss Tang and Zuoqiu can testify.

28:06.680 --> 28:07.480
That's right!

28:08.720 --> 28:10.640
Yuhan, the others, and I can all testify.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.700
We all witnessed it with our own eyes.

28:12.720 --> 28:14.250
Kang Chuyu killed Tang Rou!

28:14.560 --> 28:16.170
Kang Chuyu was someone

28:16.200 --> 28:17.460
who watched us grow up.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.800
Yet he did such a shady thing.

28:20.000 --> 28:22.200
He truly betrayed our parents' trust.

28:23.070 --> 28:25.110
Yiren, Kaiyan,

28:26.440 --> 28:28.240
why aren't you surprised at all?

28:30.310 --> 28:31.110
About Kang...

28:31.350 --> 28:32.880
About Kang Chuyu's matter.

28:33.110 --> 28:35.720
Qu Hanshan has already explained it.

28:36.110 --> 28:37.160
Mr. Qu discovered that

28:37.160 --> 28:39.750
Kang Chuyu was the Nameless Demon
from the Power Gang.

28:39.750 --> 28:41.750
He managed to lure him
to his residence for arrest,

28:41.750 --> 28:43.240
but your brother came out of nowhere

28:43.240 --> 28:44.240
and screwed it up.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.160
Not only did the suspect escape,

28:46.160 --> 28:47.690
but he was also besmirched.

28:49.550 --> 28:50.680
That's impossible.

28:50.960 --> 28:53.550
Do you think
I can't tell right from wrong?

28:53.870 --> 28:54.400
Alright,

28:54.940 --> 28:57.110
I'll believe you
in Kang Chuyu's matter for now.

28:57.110 --> 29:00.240
But Mr. Qu has been holding sway
over Guangling for over three decades.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.920
People have always spoken highly of him.

29:01.920 --> 29:02.450
Besides,

29:02.680 --> 29:04.510
he was just trying to capture Kang Chuyu.

29:04.510 --> 29:06.270
How could he possibly be
one of the Power Gang?

29:06.270 --> 29:09.130
I think your lack
of experience in the martial world

29:09.480 --> 29:10.480
made you act recklessly

29:10.480 --> 29:11.940
before things were clear,

29:12.070 --> 29:14.750
resulting in this misunderstanding
with Mr. Qu.

29:14.750 --> 29:15.310
Yiren,

29:17.030 --> 29:19.090
it's really not a misunderstanding.

29:19.680 --> 29:21.160
We saw it with our own eyes.

29:22.510 --> 29:24.110
Qu Hanshan has deceived you.

29:24.550 --> 29:25.550
I can testify too.

29:25.830 --> 29:28.000
Everything Xiao Qiushui said is true.

29:28.830 --> 29:31.790
Kang Chuyu and Qu Hanshan were in cahoots.

29:32.030 --> 29:32.640
Miss Tang,

29:33.110 --> 29:35.550
your Tang Sect
and our Xiao family are both in Jinzhong.

29:35.550 --> 29:37.200
But when the Sword Manor is under siege,

29:37.200 --> 29:39.360
has your Tang Sect offered any help?

29:40.350 --> 29:41.810
Your Tang Sect's attitude

29:42.110 --> 29:44.180
has already
disappointed our family deeply.

29:44.180 --> 29:46.600
How can I believe your testimony now?

29:46.880 --> 29:48.340
The Tang Sect is one thing,

29:48.980 --> 29:50.380
and Miss Tang is another.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.520
You can't mix them together.

29:59.000 --> 29:59.830
Even Rou

30:02.310 --> 30:03.570
died trying to save me.

30:08.590 --> 30:11.550
Yiren, your words

30:13.480 --> 30:14.680
truly disappoint me.

30:20.160 --> 30:21.760
Young Master! Young Master!

30:22.680 --> 30:24.540
There's a letter from Qu Hanshan.

30:25.950 --> 30:27.400
[Challenge Letter]

30:35.000 --> 30:37.110
It's a challenge letter from Qu Hanshan,

30:37.110 --> 30:38.920
saying that you, Qiushui,
are slandering him.

30:38.920 --> 30:40.350
He wants to prove his innocence.

30:40.350 --> 30:43.440
Otherwise, his standing
in the martial world will be ruined.

30:43.440 --> 30:44.180
So he wants you

30:44.180 --> 30:46.160
to face him in a duel
at his mansion tomorrow

30:46.160 --> 30:47.480
to prove his innocence.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.540
Qiushui cannot go.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.200
If he goes, I'm afraid

30:50.200 --> 30:51.460
he'll face a disaster.

30:52.000 --> 30:54.000
Not to mention the gap in martial arts,

30:54.000 --> 30:55.750
if Qiushui shows up for the fight,

30:55.750 --> 30:58.160
he'll be positioned against
the entire Guangling martial community.

30:58.160 --> 30:58.890
Don't worry.

30:59.310 --> 31:00.440
If someone has to go,

31:00.440 --> 31:01.570
I'll go in his place.

31:01.960 --> 31:03.720
But once we accept the challenge,

31:03.720 --> 31:05.920
the consequences will be devastating.

31:06.000 --> 31:08.660
Not only will Qiushui
become everyone's enemy,

31:08.990 --> 31:12.200
but the Xiao family will also be isolated
without support.

31:12.200 --> 31:12.790
Yiren,

31:13.750 --> 31:15.480
don't you understand even now?

31:15.920 --> 31:18.120
Qu Hanshan plans to kill and silence me.

31:18.400 --> 31:20.330
But none of this matters right now.

31:20.350 --> 31:21.640
The first priority is

31:22.310 --> 31:24.070
to figure out
how to rescue Father and Mother

31:24.070 --> 31:25.730
and keep the Sword Manor safe.

31:26.070 --> 31:27.470
So Yiren, Kaiyan, Xueyu,

31:27.790 --> 31:29.880
we need to come up
with a plan immediately

31:29.880 --> 31:32.070
to help the Sword Manor out of danger
in the fastest way.

31:32.070 --> 31:33.640
Having offended Mr. Qu,
you're going against

31:33.640 --> 31:35.240
the martial community in Guangling.

31:35.240 --> 31:37.970
Who else
would help the Sword Manor at this point?

31:39.640 --> 31:40.700
If that's the case,

31:41.810 --> 31:43.870
we should leave Guangling right away

31:44.030 --> 31:47.030
and go to Shaolin, Wudang,
or the other sects in Wubei.

31:47.400 --> 31:50.160
I believe with our parents' reputation
in the martial world,

31:50.160 --> 31:51.790
among their numerous friends,

31:51.790 --> 31:53.830
there must be someone
who will come to our aid.

31:53.830 --> 31:55.090
Easier said than done.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.920
Guangling and Wubei have always been

31:56.920 --> 31:58.650
allies through thick and thin.

31:58.880 --> 32:00.830
It's not as easy

32:00.830 --> 32:02.200
as your armchair strategies.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.960
Sort out your own affairs first!

32:03.960 --> 32:04.510
Yiren!

32:04.790 --> 32:06.720
Qiushui,
the innocent will be proven innocent.

32:06.720 --> 32:07.650
No more arguing.

32:08.200 --> 32:10.480
The truth will come to light one day.

32:12.030 --> 32:12.720
Mr. Xiao...

32:13.030 --> 32:14.090
Enough, Miss Tang.

32:14.480 --> 32:15.790
This is our family affair.

32:15.790 --> 32:17.790
The Tang Sect should not interfere.

32:18.550 --> 32:20.950
Qiushui, stay at home and behave yourself.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.900
Don't cause any more trouble.

32:23.030 --> 32:23.560
Shinian!

32:23.880 --> 32:24.400
Yes!

32:24.480 --> 32:25.070
Yiren.

32:25.070 --> 32:26.680
Before we get to the bottom of it,

32:26.680 --> 32:29.340
don't let the Third Young Master
leave his room.

32:29.590 --> 32:30.320
Understood.

32:47.550 --> 32:48.110
How's it?

32:51.440 --> 32:54.500
The Baizhan Sect, Pili Hall,
and Xiaoyao Sect all claim

32:54.830 --> 32:56.430
that their Sect Leaders are away.

32:56.430 --> 32:57.630
There's no response.

32:57.880 --> 33:00.160
We did meet with Master Ge
from the Divine Blade Hall,

33:00.160 --> 33:00.880
but he said

33:01.270 --> 33:04.410
that if we couldn't clear up
the misunderstanding with Mr. Qu,

33:04.410 --> 33:05.560
he wouldn't help us.

33:07.310 --> 33:10.240
Is there not a single person
willing to step forward?

33:11.590 --> 33:13.270
The two biggest shots
in Guangling right now

33:13.270 --> 33:14.690
are Mr. Qu and Mr. Liang.

33:15.000 --> 33:17.510
But Mr. Liang has no fixed abode

33:17.790 --> 33:18.850
and is hard to find.

33:19.550 --> 33:22.420
All 16 major sects
follow Qu Hanshan's lead.

33:22.990 --> 33:24.160
Without his authorization,

33:24.160 --> 33:25.760
no one dares to agree to help.

33:26.810 --> 33:27.780
Let's not rush.

33:28.790 --> 33:29.920
Hope the Bishan Sect

33:30.270 --> 33:32.600
can show some kindness to our Xiao family.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.680
Young Master, Miss Weng is here.

33:38.640 --> 33:40.590
-Miss Weng.
-Greetings, Miss Weng.

33:40.590 --> 33:41.150
This way, please.

33:41.150 --> 33:41.610
Please.

33:45.880 --> 33:48.230
Miss Weng, is everything going

33:48.400 --> 33:49.000
smoothly?

33:49.830 --> 33:51.720
Our sect leader had agreed to help.

33:51.720 --> 33:52.880
But who knew your brother, Xiao Qiushui,

33:52.880 --> 33:55.880
would end up
holding such a serious grudge with Mr. Qu?

33:57.440 --> 33:58.680
Even if my sect fellows won't come,

33:58.680 --> 34:00.480
I will still do my utmost to help.

34:01.350 --> 34:03.210
But my strength alone is limited,

34:03.640 --> 34:05.840
so I can hardly help you turn the tables.

34:09.190 --> 34:12.480
And I'm curious how Qiushui is so sure

34:13.280 --> 34:15.810
that Mr. Qu is the Sword King
of the Power Gang.

34:16.400 --> 34:18.480
Qiushui said that yesterday
at Qu's residence,

34:18.480 --> 34:20.880
he heard Mr. Qu admit
to being the Sword King

34:20.880 --> 34:22.610
and saw him kill Mr. Gu Junshan.

34:23.280 --> 34:24.480
How is that possible?

34:25.030 --> 34:27.159
Isn't Gu Junshan still alive and well?

34:27.710 --> 34:28.630
What?

34:29.880 --> 34:32.800
Today they just had a discussion
with my sect leader.

34:32.800 --> 34:34.480
I saw them off in person.

34:42.960 --> 34:44.219
Greetings, Miss Weng.

34:44.710 --> 34:45.320
Xiaoyi.

34:45.920 --> 34:46.960
I found something.

34:46.960 --> 34:49.000
Tie Xingyue and Qiu Nangu,

34:49.000 --> 34:50.150
who followed Qiushui earlier,

34:50.150 --> 34:52.000
used to keep talking about
joining the Power Gang

34:52.000 --> 34:53.530
when they were in Jinzhong.

34:53.630 --> 34:55.610
And they have close ties
with the Burrow Demon

34:55.610 --> 34:56.739
from the Power Gang.

35:00.150 --> 35:03.010
Could these two really be members
of the Power Gang,

35:03.710 --> 35:06.840
deliberately staying by Qiushui's side
to mislead him?

35:09.840 --> 35:12.320
Seems like Mr. Qu was telling the truth.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.360
Qiushui was deceived by some villains

35:14.360 --> 35:16.360
and failed to tell right from wrong.

35:18.800 --> 35:21.000
It's too early to draw conclusions now.

35:21.440 --> 35:23.500
Qiushui might have fallen into a trap

35:23.710 --> 35:25.040
and didn't mean to do it.

35:25.740 --> 35:26.940
What matters most now

35:27.230 --> 35:29.490
is to prevent things from getting worse.

35:30.470 --> 35:31.510
We must resolve

35:31.510 --> 35:32.920
the conflict with Mr. Qu.

35:33.400 --> 35:35.530
The key is to seek help from Guangling.

35:35.790 --> 35:37.450
We cannot make the Xiao family

35:37.840 --> 35:39.800
antagonize everyone at this moment.

35:39.800 --> 35:42.670
But now Mr. Qu insists on a duel
to the death.

35:43.630 --> 35:44.890
How can we remedy this?

35:48.440 --> 35:49.280
Years ago,

35:49.550 --> 35:51.110
Mr. Qu and I caught a spy

35:51.110 --> 35:52.920
from the Northern Wasteland together.

35:52.920 --> 35:55.580
We built some rapport
during that cooperation.

35:55.800 --> 35:58.280
How about I go try to mediate?

35:59.150 --> 36:00.150
If he relents,

36:00.550 --> 36:04.610
there's still room for negotiation
regarding the aid to the Sword Manor.

36:05.400 --> 36:07.000
Thank you so much, Miss Weng.

36:07.960 --> 36:10.280
Liang, please take Miss Weng to rest.

36:10.760 --> 36:11.760
This way, please.

36:15.960 --> 36:16.590
Kaiyan,

36:17.150 --> 36:20.280
then we should go
apologize to Mr. Qu as soon as possible.

36:21.110 --> 36:21.840
Yiren,

36:22.960 --> 36:25.960
don't you find this matter fishy?

36:26.670 --> 36:28.630
Qiushui always likes to fool around.

36:28.630 --> 36:30.230
He does act weirdly at times.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.490
But he's always been vigilant.

36:32.670 --> 36:35.800
I never expected him
to be so easily deceived by someone.

36:36.000 --> 36:37.800
We can't blame it all on Qiushui.

36:37.920 --> 36:40.480
After all,
the Power Gang came well-prepared.

36:40.480 --> 36:41.940
They're just too cunning.

36:42.530 --> 36:44.990
Let's go to Qu's Mansion first
to take a look.

36:45.000 --> 36:47.440
Let's do our best
to resolve the conflict with Mr. Qu.

36:47.440 --> 36:49.040
If what Qiushui said is true,

36:49.150 --> 36:52.150
then he'll certainly
give himself away at some point.

37:08.480 --> 37:09.150
Miss Tang.

37:10.910 --> 37:13.070
Miss Tang,
without the Young Master's permission,

37:13.070 --> 37:14.880
you can't go in
to see the Third Young Master.

37:14.880 --> 37:16.360
I just want to go in and talk to him.

37:16.360 --> 37:17.230
Why can't I?

37:21.800 --> 37:24.000
Qiushui, this door is heavily guarded.

37:24.070 --> 37:25.590
I'll figure out another way later.

37:25.590 --> 37:26.360
See you soon.

37:47.060 --> 37:48.460
[Weng Yueying lied that Free-Spirited Sage
had been to the Bishan Sect.]

37:48.460 --> 37:49.860
[Xiao Yiren trusts her and is going
to seek peace with Qu Hanshan.]

37:50.550 --> 37:53.710
Could it be that even Miss Weng is
a member of the Power Gang?

37:53.710 --> 37:55.840
Qu Hanshan is unbelievably powerful.

37:57.230 --> 37:57.800
No,

37:58.440 --> 38:00.170
I can't sit back and do nothing.

38:04.670 --> 38:05.200
Let me go.

38:05.280 --> 38:06.340
I need to see Yiren.

38:08.550 --> 38:10.070
Without the Young Leader's order,

38:10.070 --> 38:11.280
we can't let you out.

38:11.670 --> 38:13.320
Please don't make things hard for us.

38:13.320 --> 38:13.850
Make way!

38:15.670 --> 38:16.230
Stop.

38:20.380 --> 38:22.180
Xueyu, are you here to let me out?

38:23.400 --> 38:25.060
Without Yiren's permission,

38:25.510 --> 38:27.110
Shinian won't let you leave.

38:28.800 --> 38:29.280
Xueyu,

38:30.360 --> 38:32.510
the news
about the Free-Spirited Sage is fake.

38:32.510 --> 38:34.760
I saw him killed
by Qu Hanshan with my own eyes.

38:34.760 --> 38:36.760
If Miss Weng wasn't being deceived,

38:37.030 --> 38:39.090
then she must be one of the Power Gang.

38:39.400 --> 38:42.480
Qiushui, we don't have any other evidence

38:42.690 --> 38:43.750
to convince Yiren.

38:43.830 --> 38:46.160
And the others won't believe what you say.

38:46.440 --> 38:47.640
If you're right,

38:47.960 --> 38:49.440
and even Miss Weng from Bishan Sect

38:49.440 --> 38:51.040
is also one of the Power Gang,

38:51.190 --> 38:52.960
then I'm afraid there's no one left

38:52.960 --> 38:55.220
in the entire martial world we can trust.

38:55.710 --> 38:58.630
Anyway, Xueyu, you can't trust anyone

38:58.920 --> 39:00.320
working with Qu Hanshan.

39:00.320 --> 39:01.710
I won't go into details now.

39:01.710 --> 39:02.920
I need to hurry and stop Yiren.

39:02.920 --> 39:04.360
Qiushui, listen to me.

39:04.550 --> 39:06.480
Everyone in Guangling and Wubei
has rejected our request for help.

39:06.480 --> 39:08.940
If you go now,
aren't you walking into a trap?

39:09.100 --> 39:09.870
So, Xueyu,

39:11.160 --> 39:12.760
you don't believe me either?

39:12.760 --> 39:14.090
Of course I believe you.

39:14.180 --> 39:16.030
You've been strong-minded since childhood.

39:16.030 --> 39:18.320
Although I can't fully understand

39:18.840 --> 39:20.500
what you mean most of the time,

39:21.530 --> 39:23.550
I know how treacherous
people in the martial world are.

39:23.550 --> 39:26.440
Despite Yiren's years of experience
in the martial world,

39:26.440 --> 39:28.100
he can still misjudge people.

39:28.180 --> 39:28.910
So, Xueyu,

39:29.570 --> 39:30.940
we must stop Yiren

39:31.590 --> 39:33.720
before he falls into the enemy's trap.

39:33.960 --> 39:35.070
I see, Qiushui.

39:35.360 --> 39:36.190
Calm down.

39:36.880 --> 39:38.340
I'll go talk to Yiren again

39:38.340 --> 39:39.670
and talk things over with him.

39:39.670 --> 39:40.190
Okay.

39:47.150 --> 39:49.800
Never thought
that Qu Hanshan would strike first.

39:49.800 --> 39:50.600
That's crazy.

39:51.360 --> 39:52.890
Now that I'm confined here,

39:53.710 --> 39:55.000
how can I be his match?

39:56.390 --> 39:58.790
No, I can't think this way.

39:59.760 --> 40:02.420
No matter how powerful he is,
he can also slip up.

40:02.550 --> 40:04.440
I need to try to get
the Sect Leader's Token from Yiren.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.970
And it might give me a chance

40:06.510 --> 40:08.110
to rewrite the story

40:09.290 --> 40:11.890
and get rid of the Sword King
and the Power Gang.

40:36.000 --> 40:36.630
Master.

40:37.280 --> 40:40.410
Xiao Yiren is waiting outside
and insists on seeing you.

40:41.550 --> 40:43.680
Liu Suifeng is indeed a great schemer.

40:44.340 --> 40:45.340
Xiao Yiren really

40:45.360 --> 40:47.230
came to beg for my help again.

40:49.480 --> 40:50.710
The Xiaos

40:50.710 --> 40:53.840
always disguise themselves
under the name of chivalry.

40:55.030 --> 40:58.650
Let's use this to deliver
the final fatal blow to Xiao Qiushui.

41:14.110 --> 41:14.760
Did it go well?

41:14.760 --> 41:16.360
How's it? What did Mr. Qu say?

41:17.800 --> 41:19.320
Things didn't go smoothly at first.

41:19.320 --> 41:21.670
But after Yiren's heartfelt persuasion,

41:21.770 --> 41:24.350
Mr. Qu finally decided to gather
the sixteen sects

41:24.350 --> 41:28.080
tomorrow at Top Fairness Forest
to discuss aiding the Sword Manor.

41:28.400 --> 41:29.200
That's great.

41:29.480 --> 41:31.210
Are you sure he's trustworthy?

41:32.430 --> 41:34.430
I watched him closely for a long time

41:34.710 --> 41:36.640
and didn't notice anything wrong.

41:36.880 --> 41:38.340
He should be trustworthy.

41:39.930 --> 41:41.970
But now Mr. Qu is determined

41:42.240 --> 41:44.150
to have Qiushui
apologize to him in person.

41:44.150 --> 41:45.880
It seems that he won't easily let go

41:45.880 --> 41:47.610
of the smear on his reputation.

41:48.000 --> 41:50.550
Will he make things difficult for Qiushui?

41:51.550 --> 41:52.460
At this point,

41:52.960 --> 41:54.800
Qiushui will have to bear with it.

41:54.800 --> 41:56.860
Never mind. Let it be a lesson for him.

41:57.280 --> 41:59.740
Besides, Mr. Qu is
a highly esteemed figure.

41:59.800 --> 42:01.600
In front of all the sect leaders,

42:01.880 --> 42:03.410
he won't go too far, I think.

42:04.920 --> 42:05.510
Okay.

42:06.000 --> 42:07.960
Then tomorrow, you and Kaiyan

42:07.960 --> 42:09.880
escort Qiushui to Top Fairness Forest.

42:09.880 --> 42:11.510
I'll continue organizing the aid

42:11.510 --> 42:13.360
and make all necessary arrangements.

42:13.360 --> 42:14.760
Once the matter
at Top Fairness Forest is settled,

42:14.760 --> 42:17.440
we'll immediately join forces
and head back for reinforcements.

42:17.440 --> 42:20.770
Yiren, please make sure
you protect Qiushui well tomorrow.

42:21.710 --> 42:22.510
Rest assured.

42:22.670 --> 42:24.110
Yiren and Kaiyang will both be there.

42:24.110 --> 42:25.710
They'll definitely keep Qiushui safe.

42:25.710 --> 42:26.910
Don't worry too much.

42:29.500 --> 42:31.100
[Sect Leader's Token]

42:29.880 --> 42:31.280
The Sect Leader's Token?

42:33.630 --> 42:36.090
He wants us to steal
the Sect Leader's Token?

42:37.920 --> 42:39.150
That's ridiculous!

42:40.270 --> 42:42.920
What does Qiushui
want the Sect Leader's Token for?

42:42.920 --> 42:43.920
He didn't tell me.

42:44.960 --> 42:47.320
Although he usually acts wild and unruly,

42:47.340 --> 42:48.540
seeming unreliable,

42:48.800 --> 42:50.600
he always knows what he's doing.

42:50.840 --> 42:53.040
He must have his reasons for doing this.

42:53.230 --> 42:53.920
I agree.

42:54.440 --> 42:55.440
Being predictable

42:55.440 --> 42:56.710
isn't Big Brother's style.

42:56.710 --> 42:58.550
I'll continue to support him this time.

42:58.550 --> 42:59.320
Of course!

42:59.710 --> 43:01.000
Big Brother trusts us so much.

43:01.000 --> 43:02.280
We definitely won't let him down.
